     "text": "Two big points from this new Anthropic paper:\n1) The most AI value comes from changing the organization & roles\n2) There is wide worker resistance to AI adoption (partially due to point 1)\n\nChanges that expand what workers do & share AI gains with them could help. www.anthropic.com/research/wor..."
